<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head><%- include('../partials/head', { pageTitle: 'Información' }) %></head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/navbar') %>
  <div class="container">

    <!-- Tabs -->
    <div class="page-section" style="padding-bottom:0">
      <div class="ranking-tabs">
        <a href="/info?s=general"  class="ranking-tab <%= seccion === 'general'  ? 'active' : '' %>">General</a>
        <a href="/info?s=planes"   class="ranking-tab <%= seccion === 'planes'   ? 'active' : '' %>">Planes</a>
        <a href="/info?s=horarios" class="ranking-tab <%= seccion === 'horarios' ? 'active' : '' %>">Horarios</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ══ GENERAL (incluye instalaciones) ══════════════════════════════════ -->
    <% if (seccion === 'general') { %>
    <section class="page-section">

      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-label">Sobre nosotros</div>
        <h1 class="text-h1">Byle Gym</h1>
        <p class="section-desc">Tu centro deportivo en Los Mochis, Sinaloa — más de 1,200 m² para que alcances tus metas.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats -->
      <div class="info-stats-row">
        <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-val">350</span><span class="info-stat-unit">+</span><span class="info-stat-label">Socios activos</span></div>
        <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-val">10</span><span class="info-stat-unit">+</span><span class="info-stat-label">Clases grupales</span></div>
        <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-val">1,200</span><span class="info-stat-unit"> m²</span><span class="info-stat-label">Instalaciones</span></div>
        <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-val">5</span><span class="info-stat-unit">am</span><span class="info-stat-label">Abrimos</span></div>
      </div>

      <!-- ¿Por qué elegirnos? -->
      <div class="section-label mt-xl">¿Por qué Byle Gym?</div>
      <div class="why-grid mt-sm">
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg></div>
          <div class="why-title">Equipo de primer nivel</div>
          <p class="why-desc">Máquinas y pesas de última generación, mantenidas y actualizadas constantemente para tu seguridad.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><polyline points="16 11 18 13 22 9"/></svg></div>
          <div class="why-title">Entrenadores certificados</div>
          <p class="why-desc">Coaches especializados en fuerza, crossfit, yoga y nutrición deportiva que te guían en cada etapa.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg></div>
          <div class="why-title">Horarios flexibles</div>
          <p class="why-desc">Abrimos desde las 5am de lunes a sábado para adaptarnos a cualquier rutina de vida.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/></svg></div>
          <div class="why-title">Seguimiento de progreso</div>
          <p class="why-desc">Portal web para ver asistencias, records personales y estado de membresía en tiempo real.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11"/></svg></div>
          <div class="why-title">Comunidad y competencias</div>
          <p class="why-desc">Ranking de constancia, competencias internas y un ambiente donde todos se motivan mutuamente.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div>
          <div class="why-title">Ubicación céntrica</div>
          <p class="why-desc">En el corazón de Los Mochis — fácil acceso, estacionamiento disponible y bien conectado.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Zonas del gimnasio -->
      <div class="section-label mt-xl">Nuestras instalaciones</div>
      <div class="area-grid mt-sm">
        <div class="area-card">
          <div class="area-card-banner" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534438327276-14e5300c3a48?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=75')">
            <div class="area-card-banner-label"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg><span>Pesas libre</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="area-card-body">
            <div class="area-card-name">Área de Pesas Libre</div>
            <p class="area-card-desc">Zona de fuerza e hipertrofia con mancuernas, barras olímpicas, jaulas de sentadilla y múltiples estaciones. Ideal para todos los niveles.</p>
            <div class="area-card-tags">
              <span class="area-tag">Mancuernas 2.5–50 kg</span>
              <span class="area-tag">Barras olímpicas</span>
              <span class="area-tag">Jaulas de squat</span>
              <span class="area-tag">Press banca</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="area-card">
          <div class="area-card-banner" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526506118085-60ce8714f8c5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=75')">
            <div class="area-card-banner-label"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg><span>Cardio</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="area-card-body">
            <div class="area-card-name">Zona Cardiovascular</div>
            <p class="area-card-desc">Amplia área de cardio con cintas, bicicletas estáticas, elípticas y escaladoras. Pantallas integradas para monitorear tu rendimiento.</p>
            <div class="area-card-tags">
              <span class="area-tag">10+ Cintas</span>
              <span class="area-tag">Bicicletas estáticas</span>
              <span class="area-tag">Elípticas</span>
              <span class="area-tag">Escaladoras</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="area-card">
          <div class="area-card-banner" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518611012118-696072aa579a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=75')">
            <div class="area-card-banner-label"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg><span>Clases grupales</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="area-card-body">
            <div class="area-card-name">Salón de Clases Grupales</div>
            <p class="area-card-desc">Espacio amplio para crossfit, yoga, box y spinning. Cupos limitados para mayor atención personalizada con coaches certificados.</p>
            <div class="area-card-tags">
              <span class="area-tag">Crossfit</span>
              <span class="area-tag">Yoga</span>
              <span class="area-tag">Box</span>
              <span class="area-tag">Spinning</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="area-card">
          <div class="area-card-banner" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571019613454-1cb2f99b2d8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=75')">
            <div class="area-card-banner-label"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="7.5" cy="15.5" r="5.5"/><path d="m21 2-9.6 9.6"/><path d="m15.5 7.5 3 3L22 7l-3-3"/></svg><span>Vestidores</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="area-card-body">
            <div class="area-card-name">Vestidores y Recepción</div>
            <p class="area-card-desc">Vestidores con casilleros asignados por membresía, regaderas y área de descanso. Personal en recepción para orientarte desde el primer día.</p>
            <div class="area-card-tags">
              <span class="area-tag">Casilleros seguros</span>
              <span class="area-tag">Regaderas</span>
              <span class="area-tag">Descanso</span>
              <span class="area-tag">CCTV 24/7</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Equipamiento destacado -->
      <div class="section-label mt-xl">Equipamiento destacado</div>
      <div class="equip-grid mt-sm">
        <div class="equip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>10 Cintas caminadoras</div>
        <div class="equip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>8 Bicicletas spinning</div>
        <div class="equip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>6 Elípticas</div>
        <div class="equip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Mancuernas hasta 50 kg</div>
        <div class="equip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>4 Jaulas de squat</div>
        <div class="equip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Cables y poleas</div>
        <div class="equip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Máquinas Hammer Strength</div>
        <div class="equip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Colchonetas de yoga</div>
        <div class="equip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Costales de box</div>
        <div class="equip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Báscula digital</div>
        <div class="equip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Casilleros con llave</div>
        <div class="equip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Vigilancia CCTV</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Galería -->
      <div class="section-label mt-xl">Galería</div>
      <div class="gallery-grid-new mt-sm">
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534438327276-14e5300c3a48?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&h=450&q=75" alt="Área de pesas" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517836357463-d25dfeac3438?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&h=450&q=75" alt="Entrenamiento de fuerza" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526506118085-60ce8714f8c5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&h=450&q=75" alt="Zona cardiovascular" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518611012118-696072aa579a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&h=450&q=75" alt="Clases grupales" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571019613454-1cb2f99b2d8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&h=450&q=75" alt="Instalaciones" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540497077202-7c8a3999166f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&h=450&q=75" alt="Área de musculación" loading="lazy">
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-caption mt-sm" style="color:var(--text-muted);text-align:center">Fotos ilustrativas · Próximamente fotos reales del gimnasio</p>

      <!-- Contacto -->
      <div class="section-label mt-xl">Contacto y ubicación</div>
      <div class="card mt-sm">
        <div class="list-item">
          <div class="list-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div>
          <div class="list-content"><div class="list-title">Los Mochis, Sinaloa</div><div class="list-subtitle">Col. Centro — visítanos para conocer la dirección exacta</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <div class="list-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg></div>
          <div class="list-content"><div class="list-title">Lun–Vie: 5am – 10pm &nbsp;·&nbsp; Sáb: 5am – 2pm</div><div class="list-subtitle">Domingo cerrado</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <div class="list-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/></svg></div>
          <div class="list-content"><div class="list-title">Redes sociales</div></div>
          <div class="list-right" style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap">
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Instagram</a>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Facebook</a>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">TikTok</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="info-cta mt-xl">
        <div class="section-label">¿Listo para empezar?</div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-sm">Únete a Byle Gym hoy</h2>
        <p class="text-body mb-lg" style="color:var(--text-secondary)">Pre-regístrate online y ve a pagar a la sucursal. Sin filas, sin esperas.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:.75rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <a href="/hazte-socio" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Hazte socio</a>
          <a href="/info?s=horarios" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Ver horarios</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </section>
    <% } %>

    <!-- ══ PLANES ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <% if (seccion === 'planes') { %>
    <section class="page-section">

      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-label">Membresías</div>
        <h1 class="text-h1">Planes y membresías</h1>
        <p class="section-desc">Todos incluyen acceso completo a las instalaciones. Elige el que mejor se adapte a ti.</p>
      </div>

      <% if (membresias && membresias.length > 0) { %>
      <div class="info-stats-row" style="margin-bottom:2rem">
        <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-val"><%= membresias.length %></span><span class="info-stat-label">planes disponibles</span></div>
        <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-val">5</span><span class="info-stat-unit">am</span><span class="info-stat-label">abrimos</span></div>
        <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-val">350</span><span class="info-stat-unit">+</span><span class="info-stat-label">socios activos</span></div>
        <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-val">10</span><span class="info-stat-unit">+</span><span class="info-stat-label">clases grupales</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-plan-grid">
        <% const midIdx = Math.floor(membresias.length / 2); %>
        <% membresias.forEach(function(plan, i) {
             const meses = plan.duracion_dias >= 60 ? Math.round(plan.duracion_dias / 30) : null;
             const periodoLabel = meses ? '/' + meses + ' meses' : '/mes';
             const durLabel = meses ? plan.duracion_dias + ' días · ' + meses + ' meses' : plan.duracion_dias + ' días';
             const isFeatured = (membresias.length > 1 && i === midIdx);
             const isOferta = plan.estado === 'oferta';
             const isTemporada = plan.estado === 'temporada';
        %>
        <div class="info-plan-card<%= isFeatured ? ' featured' : '' %>">
          <div class="info-plan-badges">
            <% if (isFeatured) { %><span class="info-plan-badge badge-featured">Recomendado</span><% } %>
            <% if (isOferta) { %><span class="info-plan-badge badge-oferta">Oferta</span><% } %>
            <% if (isTemporada) { %><span class="info-plan-badge badge-temporada">Temporada</span><% } %>
          </div>
          <div class="info-plan-name"><%= plan.nombre_membresia %></div>
          <div class="info-plan-price-row">
            <span class="info-plan-price">$<%= Number(plan.precio).toLocaleString('es-MX') %></span>
            <span class="info-plan-period"><%= periodoLabel %></span>
          </div>
          <span class="info-plan-dur"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg><%= durLabel %></span>
          <div class="info-plan-divider"></div>
          <% if (plan.descripcion) { %>
          <p class="info-plan-desc"><%= plan.descripcion %></p>
          <% } else { %>
          <p class="info-plan-desc-empty">Acceso completo a todas las instalaciones del gimnasio.</p>
          <% } %>
          <div class="info-plan-features">
            <div class="info-plan-feat">Acceso a pesas y zona cardio</div>
            <div class="info-plan-feat">Horario completo (5am–10pm)</div>
            <div class="info-plan-feat">Portal web y seguimiento de asistencias</div>
            <% if (isFeatured || plan.duracion_dias >= 60) { %>
            <div class="info-plan-feat">Clases grupales incluidas</div>
            <% } %>
            <% if (plan.duracion_dias >= 60) { %>
            <div class="info-plan-feat">Descuento por pago adelantado</div>
            <% } %>
          </div>
          <a href="/hazte-socio" class="btn <%= isFeatured ? 'btn-primary' : 'btn-secondary' %> btn-block" style="margin-top:auto">Elegir este plan</a>
        </div>
        <% }); %>
      </div>
      <p class="text-caption mt-xl text-center" style="color:var(--text-muted)">
        Los precios pueden variar. Consulta en sucursal para promociones vigentes. · <a href="/hazte-socio">Pre-regístrate aquí</a>
      </p>
      <% } else { %>
      <div class="card" style="text-align:center;padding:3rem">
        <p class="text-body" style="color:var(--text-muted)">No hay planes disponibles en este momento. <a href="/hazte-socio">Contáctanos</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <% } %>

    </section>
    <% } %>

    <!-- ══ HORARIOS ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <% if (seccion === 'horarios') { %>
    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="section-header"><h1 class="text-h1">Horarios</h1></div>
      <div class="card mb-lg">
        <h3 class="text-h3 mb-md">Horario del gimnasio</h3>
        <div class="list-item"><div class="list-content"><div class="list-title">Lunes a Viernes</div></div><div class="list-right"><strong>5:00 AM – 10:00 PM</strong></div></div>
        <div class="list-item"><div class="list-content"><div class="list-title">Sábado</div></div><div class="list-right"><strong>5:00 AM – 2:00 PM</strong></div></div>
        <div class="list-item"><div class="list-content"><div class="list-title">Domingo</div></div><div class="list-right"><span class="badge badge-error">Cerrado</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-h2 mb-md">Clases grupales</h3>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="schedule-item"><div class="schedule-time"><div class="hour">7:00</div><div class="period">AM</div></div><div class="schedule-info"><div class="schedule-name">Crossfit</div><div class="schedule-meta">Coach Roberto · 45 min · Lun/Mié/Vie</div></div></div>
        <div class="schedule-item"><div class="schedule-time"><div class="hour">9:00</div><div class="period">AM</div></div><div class="schedule-info"><div class="schedule-name">Yoga</div><div class="schedule-meta">Coach Laura · 60 min · Mar/Jue</div></div></div>
        <div class="schedule-item"><div class="schedule-time"><div class="hour">6:00</div><div class="period">PM</div></div><div class="schedule-info"><div class="schedule-name">Spinning</div><div class="schedule-meta">Coach Diana · 50 min · Lun/Mié/Vie</div></div></div>
        <div class="schedule-item"><div class="schedule-time"><div class="hour">7:30</div><div class="period">PM</div></div><div class="schedule-info"><div class="schedule-name">Box</div><div class="schedule-meta">Coach Martín · 60 min · Mar/Jue/Sáb</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <% } %>

  </div>
  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
